 "director": {
  "mode": "hand",
  "notes": "No animal, slaughter or blood drawn: wheat for food, a book for «وقد فصل لكم ما حرم عليكم». The necessity exception (119:16-19) is glossed «ما دعت إليه الضرورة بسبب المجاعة». 119:10-15 carries As-Sa'di's principle «الأصل في الأشياء والأطعمة الإباحة». STAGING v4: c1 (118-119): a household at a meal at home (the ruling on eating what Allah's name was mentioned on); no animal, meat or slaughter is drawn, wheat stands for food (118:1-3). They sit on 118:1, read on 119:11 (He has detailed what is forbidden, with the book plate). The conditional 118:7-10 is not acted. The many who mislead by their desires are only an uncountable crowd plate (119:21-25), the household shakes its head on 119:24 (As-Sa'di: beware of them); geometric for 119:27-30. c2 (120): believers in a town at dusk refuse sin (head shake on 120:1); those who earn sin (3 men in dark robes) appear on 120:6, the camera holds on them during the threat, an hourglass for the coming recompense (120:9). No dawn over the threat."
 },
